    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.basicss\n\n### Description\n\n```lua\r\nH.is_default_keymap = function(mode, lhs, map_info)\r\n  if map_info == nil then return true end\r\n\r\n  -- Some mappings are set by default in Neovim\r\n  if mode == 'n' and lhs == '<C-L>' then return map_info.rhs:find('nohl') ~= nil end\r\n  if mode == 'x' and lhs == '*' then return map_info.rhs == [[y/\\V<C-R>\"<CR>]] end\r\n  if mode == 'x' and lhs == '#' then return map_info.rhs == [[y?\\V<C-R>\"<CR>]] end\r\nend\r\n``` \r\nThe case where :find fails is not handled \r\n\r\n```powershell\r\n2023-07-10T16:23:00 lazy.nvim  ERROR Failed to run `config` for mini.basics\r\n\r\n...ata/Local/nvim-data/lazy/mini.basics/lua/mini/basics.lua:701: attempt to index field 'rhs' (a nil value)\r\n\r\n# stacktrace:\r\n  - mini.basics\\lua\\mini\\basics.lua:701 _in_ **is_default_keymap**\r\n  - mini.basics\\lua\\mini\\basics.lua:690 _in_ **map**\r\n  - mini.basics\\lua\\mini\\basics.lua:650 _in_ **apply_mappings**\r\n  - mini.basics\\lua\\mini\\basics.lua:428 _in_ **apply_config**\r\n  - mini.basics\\lua\\mini\\basics.lua:82 _in_ **setup**\r\n  - AppData/Local/nvim/lua/astronvim/utils/init.lua:144\r\n````\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNightly\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWindows 11\r\nWindows Terminal\r\nNeovim Nightly\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo Error\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nError",
